  "judgementCalls": [
    "The explicit JSON-only request overrides the brief README.md filename; this README.json contains the requested summary and validation results.",
    "Existing catalogue and list fields are taken directly from seed.ts. New metadata is appended; original nested option and list-item fields retain their values and order.",
    "The highlighters-4 special remains absent, as in seed.ts: its discount is applied live by the demo script.",
    "Only the five existing fictional brand labels are used; no additional brands were introduced.",
    "Every object record, including subcategories, options, specs, dimensions, specials, bulk tiers and school-list items, is explicitly demo true.",
    "Each option is independently stocked; parent option-product SKUs identify catalogue entries and never receive stock movements.",
    "Option-level reorder rules override parent defaults, so ten-packs and single exercise books have separate replenishment quantities. Pack options also carry packed weights, dimensions and cost prices.",
    "Costs are 62 percent of the ex-VAT regular retail price, rounded to cents. Product retail, option, bulk and special prices include VAT; cost prices exclude VAT.",
    "Stock history uses calendar-day supplier lead times, with Sunday deliveries moved to Monday. All movements are Monday–Saturday in the 06:00–16:00 UTC window.",
    "Receipts are triggered by a real sale reaching the reorder point, followed by the full supplier lead time; quantities equal reorderQty. Returns and damaged-unit adjustments occur on subsets of SKUs; stocktake discrepancies include both gains and losses before reorder.",
    "Low-stock and sold-out SKUs sell down to the reorder point between 29 and 31 October. Their next receipts fall after the cutoff and appear only in pendingReorders, not in stock-movements.json.",
    "Opening balances and subsequent sales determine the exact closing stock; no artificial closing adjustment is used.",
    "Seasonality is represented by denser late-October school demand, October/November planner demand and a higher November gift sales rate.",
    "Generic catalogue descriptions, product specifications, packed sizes and prices are invented POC values, not assertions about real stock or supplier quotes.",
    "No phone numbers, street addresses, people, certifications or awards were added.",
    "EAN-13 values use the requested restricted-circulation prefix 20 and correct check digits; uniqueness is asserted within this dataset, not globally.",
    "Tracked apps/packages contents changed concurrently between snapshots (including a staged deletion of one-bag.tsx). All commands for this task wrote only seed/data; no app/package edits were made by this task. The source seed.ts SHA-256 is unchanged."
  ],
